    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>护甲（轻甲），珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这套奇形怪状的黑白色调护甲铸成于 <strong>堕影冥界Shadowfell</strong> 之中，它充满着那个可怕位面的幽影能量。</p><p>穿着这套护甲期间，你为防止陷入或结束 <strong>恐慌Frightened</strong> 状态所做的豁免具有优势。</p><p>这套护甲具有3发充能。你可以消耗一发充能以用其施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.6MYwBtZurc8Zw1ac]{安定心神 Calm Emotions}</em>（豁免DC15）。这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d3]]发已消耗的充能数。</p><p>布甲由数层布料与棉料的衬里构成。</p><p>This intricate grayscale armor was forged in the Shadowfell and is infused with that plane's gloom.</p><p>While you're wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the frightened condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can expend a charge to cast the @spell[Calm Emotions] spell (save DC 15) from the armor. This armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Padded armor consists of quilted layers of cloth and batting.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
